# package.use entries the DESKTOP/PLASMA profile target ships and the HARDENED
# profile does not.
#
# The gap that made this file necessary: kde-plasma/kwin has 'lock' in IUSE
# without a '+', so the screen locker is OFF unless something turns it on, and
# what turns it on upstream is profiles/targets/desktop/plasma/package.use —
# a file the hardened profile never inherits. plasma-meta then requires
# kwin[lock] and the whole run aborts.
#
# This is the same shape as host.use next door and as the USE block in the xp
# profile: a KDE image built on a non-desktop profile has to supply, by hand,
# everything the desktop profile would have supplied. USE defaults were the
# first half of that; these per-package entries are the second.
#
# Copied verbatim from ::gentoo, 2026-08-04:
#   profiles/targets/desktop/package.use
#   profiles/targets/desktop/plasma/package.use

# --- targets/desktop/package.use ---
dev-libs/uriparser -qt6
media-libs/libwebp -tiff
media-video/pipewire sound-server
media-libs/freetype harfbuzz
net-p2p/bitcoin-core qrcode
app-text/doxygen -gui
dev-qt/qtbase libproxy
app-text/poppler nss boost
x11-base/xwayland libei
dev-build/cmake -gui
media-libs/clutter egl
media-libs/cogl gles2
media-libs/libsdl2 gles2
media-fonts/fonts-meta emoji
dev-lang/python -bluetooth
media-gfx/exiv2 xmp
dev-lang/python sqlite
net-fs/samba client
dev-libs/xmlsec nss
app-arch/unzip natspec
kde-apps/k3b taglib
kde-frameworks/kfilemetadata taglib
dev-lang/php -exif -truetype
media-video/mpv -sdl
app-text/xmlto text
x11-libs/libxcb xkb
dev-libs/libgudev introspection
xfce-base/xfdesktop thunar
net-nds/openldap minimal

# --- targets/desktop/plasma/package.use ---
net-dns/avahi mdnsresponder-compat
app-emulation/fuse -pulseaudio
dev-libs/libjcat gpg pkcs7
dev-python/pyqt6 webchannel
dev-python/pyside webchannel
dev-util/ostree curl
kde-apps/yakuake absolute-position
media-libs/gd fontconfig
media-libs/mlt ffmpeg frei0r rubberband
media-libs/opencv features2d
media-libs/opencv contrib contribdnn
net-firewall/nftables json python xtables
sys-libs/zlib minizip
virtual/zlib minizip
kde-plasma/kwin lock
kde-plasma/kwin-x11 lock
